WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
What level is your cultivation level?

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:05,080
The Northern Barbarian leader who can instantly kill the peak acquired the day after tomorrow

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,960
You are not a person who is born with nothing, are you, Commander-in-Chief?

4
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,380
I have no cultivation

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,660
No cultivation

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,960
No cultivation

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,200
Then how did you stop those Northern Barbarian cavalry?

8
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,000
He also killed the Northern Barbarian leader who was at his peak the day after tomorrow.

9
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,260
I am born with supernatural powers

10
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:30,940
You lift the gate of the Imperial Sand Tower

11
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,780
It all depends on the body

12
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,220
It’s a pity that I can’t practice cultivation

13
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,740
But I've long been used to other people's eyes like this

14
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,370
It's okay to talk about it

15
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:53,350
To save you from being questioned again in the future, I’ll tell you.

16
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,990
Our new guy is really hard to mess with.

17
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:58,950
Do you know about the iron wooden gate of our Imperial Sand Formation?

18
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,070
It weighs five thousand gold

19
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:03,030
As a result, the recruit lifted it up easily

20
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,910
Zhao Guang and I were both scared to death at that time.
